<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-30T20:57:04.558Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 20:57:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen attacked a Plateau community, killing four civilians despite a curfew and later burned a vigilante office while arresting two suspects. In Ekiti, Sowore was attacked by alleged political thugs and accused police of downplaying the incident, and another report says he was abducted there. A police inspector and 11 civilians were killed in terror attacks on villages, and troops killed 48 ISWAP fighters and one soldier in operations in Borno and Yobe. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQNjFRRTRtYjdRdzBKWVlVenZQYzFfZFM5LWxlUDhjRFZvdlBrRmtDM0p6V29rYVFwYkNGYzB3aTlJbUJkejR5TXpMVks1eU5TY3lxMGdtYmIwN29ETGI5UkpwNVV0LWRXUjJCSm93d3N1TmRTaUdmamdvWHZuM2JGVFBzdTdzUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;DAILY TIMES Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPSlFSWTNEZXIwazIyby1aN2dIQUhtb2NNWGxoWVFVZ3FWUjRZOHNKN0ZmTlNhcG1VNEZEZllCWXA2dkt2S2ZSUmJWY1N6NGdlM2YtaGZDSGlPU1otOWZTQnZTcmVMMjk4cXlKdUpUV0xGdzVaaUpxaU1ncjZyX05jb0ttZllkcUVLQUFaNzk2UWNLRm5rbVhDN1RFVVJQQ2JLR2h5VVlDcEVWNHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Peoples Gazette Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOYm5fUE1aNFVfT0gxVzhjTVRTSlkzUG9hek9uS1hiU21Gdnpnc0ZoRU9ud0tGM0w3VHFVWl9sMU1uZnJFU2dBSUVUSjIteXhDOWFQWEwybDg4NlU1MGhQbWF6S09DMDN3QV8tSU9XM0F0VUtXYndZS2hoT2tZWVBVd1p5WHItTlVfTDZCaEZwdndUZFg5Zzh1bVpLX1ZIU2hMN1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQVUhWYTdmbWNwXy1FYVRpTE1RZnBwRm15cV9oQ0RtN0xpLTNzWVlvbU45TXFHYU9QVzYyNGNEazZFbnd0NXZlenhKbHhZVzUzdk14RW9welAxOFJXZVRvNmVhanF1WnlZU1lhWVNWLWRoT29PUjN2M3B4OHBIV0U3SU5TWnBMSk1FMGVXNVB5d2RQVkg2bHJmblEyaU9rcThEekR4NGVWem12eHFXZm1UZkhOSmw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hre